layout-default\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-item-spacing pi-title pi-secondary-background\" data-source=\"title\">Brother Alex.</h2>\n\n<figure class=\"pi-item pi-image\">\n\t<a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/task/images/7/74/Brother_Alex..png/revision/latest?cb=20231029095458\" class=\"image image-thumbnail\" title=\"Brother Alex.\">\n\t\t<img src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/task/images/7/74/Brother_Alex..png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/268?cb=20231029095458\" srcset=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/task/images/7/74/Brother_Alex..png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/268?cb=20231029095458 1x, https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/task/images/7/74/Brother_Alex..png/revision/latest?cb=20231029095458 2x\" class=\"pi-image-thumbnail\" data-relevant=\"1\" alt=\"Brother Alex.\" width=\"270\" height=\"152\" data-image-key=\"Brother_Alex..png\" data-image-name=\"Brother Alex..png\" />\n\t\t\n\t</a>\n\t\n</figure>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"series\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Series</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><a href=\"/wiki/Series_16\" title=\"Series 16\">16</a></div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"episode\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Episode</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">6</div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"winner\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Winner</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><a href=\"/wiki/Lucy_Beaumont\" title=\"Lucy Beaumont\">Lucy Beaumont</a></div>\n</div>\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Episode Guide</h2>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n\t<table class=\"pi-horizontal-group\">\n\t\n\t\n\t<thead>\n\t\t<tr>\n\t\t\n\t\t\t<th class=\"pi-horizontal-group-item pi-data-label pi-secondary-font pi-border-color pi-item-spacing\" data-source=\"previous\">← Previous</th>\n\t\t\n\t\t\t<th class=\"pi-horizontal-group-item pi-data-label pi-secondary-font pi-border-color pi-item-spacing\" data-source=\"next\">Next →</th>\n\t\t\n\t\t</tr>\n\t</thead>\n\t\n\t<tbody>\n\t<tr>\n\t\n\t\t<td class=\"pi-horizontal-group-item pi-data-value pi-font pi-border-color pi-item-spacing\" data-source=\"previous\"><a href=\"/wiki/Skateboard_Division.\" title=\"Skateboard Division.\">Skateboard Division.</a></td>\n\t\n\t\t<td class=\"pi-horizontal-group-item pi-data-value pi-font pi-border-color pi-item-spacing\" data-source=\"next\"><a href=\"/wiki/I%27m_off_to_find_a_robin.\" title=\"I&#39;m off to find a robin.\">I'm off to find a robin.</a></td>\n\t\n\t</tr>\n\t</tbody>\n</table>\n\n</section>\n</aside>\n\n<p class=\"mw-empty-elt\"></p><p><i><b>Brother Alex.</b></i> is the sixth episode of <a href=\"/wiki/Series_16\" title=\"Series 16\">Series 16</a> of <i><a href=\"/wiki/Taskmaster\" title=\"Taskmaster\">Taskmaster</a></i> and was first broadcast on <a href=\"/wiki/Channel_4\" title=\"Channel 4\">Channel 4</a> on 26 October 2023. The episode was won by <a href=\"/wiki/Lucy_Beaumont\" title=\"Lucy Beaumont\">Lucy Beaumont</a>.\n</p>\n<div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Episode_title\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Episode title</span></a>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-2 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Alternate_titles\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1.1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Alternate titles</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Episode_breakdown\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Episode breakdown</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#External_links\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">External links</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Episode_title\">Episode title</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Edit section: Episode title\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"edit-section-anon\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://taskmaster.fandom.com/wiki/Brother_Alex.?veaction=edit&amp;section=1\" aria-label=\"Edit section: Episode title\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>\"Brother Alex\" is what <a href=\"/wiki/Lucy_Beaumont\" title=\"Lucy Beaumont\">Lucy Beaumont</a> calls the character played by <a href=\"/wiki/Alex_Horne\" title=\"Alex Horne\">Alex Horne</a> in her powerful production during the <a href=\"/wiki/Present_a_piece_called_%22Heads,_Shoulders,_Knees_and_Toes%22\" title=\"Present a piece called &quot;Heads, Shoulders, Knees and Toes&quot;\">Present a piece called \"Heads, Shoulders, Knees and Toes\"</a> task. The title card shows a fake foot coming out from under a garage door, with the fake foot referencing the <a href=\"/wiki/Present_a_piece_called_%22Heads,_Shoulders,_Knees_and_Toes%22\" title=\"Present a piece called &quot;Heads, Shoulders, Knees and Toes&quot;\">Present a piece called \"Heads, Shoulders, Knees and Toes\"</a> task, and the garage door referencing the <a href=\"/wiki/Instruct_your_teammates_to_recreate_your_garage_scene\" title=\"Instruct your teammates to recreate your garage scene\">Instruct your teammates to recreate your garage scene</a> task.\n</p>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Alternate_titles\">Alternate titles</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Edit section: Alternate titles\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"edit-section-anon\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://taskmaster.fandom.com/wiki/Brother_Alex.?veaction=edit&amp;section=2\" aria-label=\"Edit section: Alternate titles\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h3>\n<ul><li>On Finland's MTV Katsomo streaming platform, this episode is titled 'Veli Alex', which translates as 'Brother Alex'.</li>\n<li>On Sweden's SVT Play streaming platform, this episode is titled 'Broder Alex', which translates as 'Brother Alex'.</li>\n<li>On Norway's Discovery+ Norge streaming platform, this episode is titled 'Bror Alex', which translates as 'Brother Alex'. Note: this Norwegian translation of the title only appears in the subtitles for the episode, whereas the episode title listed on the platform is the original English title.<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div></li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Episode_breakdown\">Episode breakdown</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Edit section: Episode breakdown\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"edit-section-anon\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://taskmaster.fandom.com/wiki/Brother_Alex.?veaction=edit&amp;section=3\" aria-label=\"Edit section: Episode breakdown\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<div class=\"mbox\"><div class=\"mbox&#95;&#95;content\"><div class=\"mbox&#95;&#95;content&#95;&#95;wrapper\"><div class=\"mbox&#95;&#95;content&#95;&#95;header\">Spoilers!</div><div class=\"mbox&#95;&#95;content&#95;&#95;text mw-collapsible\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-spoilers\">This section contains spoilers.</div><span class=\"mbox&#95;&#95;close mw-customtoggle-spoilers\" title=\"Dismiss\"></span></div></div></div>\n<table class=\"tmtable\">\n\n<tbody><tr class=\"tmtableheader\">\n<th>Task\n</th>\n<th>Description\n</th>\n<th><a href=\"/wiki/Julian_Clary\" title=\"Julian Clary\"><span style=\"color:#FFF;\">Julian Clary</span></a>\n</th>\n<th><a href=\"/wiki/Lucy_Beaumont\" title=\"Lucy Beaumont\"><span style=\"color:#FFF;\">Lucy Beaumont</span></a>\n</th>\n<th><a href=\"/wiki/Sam_Campbell\" title=\"Sam Campbell\"><span style=\"color:#FFF;\">Sam Campbell</span></a>\n</th>\n<th><a href=\"/wiki/Sue_Perkins\" title=\"Sue Perkins\"><span style=\"color:#FFF;\">Sue Perkins</span></a>\n</th>\n<th><a href=\"/wiki/Susan_Wokoma\" title=\"Susan Wokoma\"><span style=\"color:#FFF;\">Susan Wokoma</span></a>\n</th></tr>\n<tr class=\"tmtablerow\">\n<td><a href=\"/wiki/Greatest_thing_that_makes_quite_a_loud_noise_when_you_shake_it\" title=\"Greatest thing that makes quite a loud noise when you shake it\">1</a>\n</td>\n<td><b>Prize:</b> Greatest thing that makes quite a loud noise when you shake it.\n</td>\n<td>2\n</td>\n<td>4\n</td>\n<td><b>5</b>\n</td>\n<td>3\n</td>\n<td>1\n</td></tr>\n<tr class=\"tmtablerow\">\n<td><a href=\"/wiki/Avoid_the_rubbish_robots\" title=\"Avoid the rubbish robots\">2</a>\n</td>\n<td>Avoid the rubbish robots. You may not remove your blindfold at any point and at least one of your knees must be touching the floor throughout.\n</td>\n<td>1\n</td>\n<td><b>5</b>\n</td>\n<td>2\n</td>\n<td>3\n</td>\n<td>4\n</td></tr>\n<tr class=\"tmtablerow\">\n<td rowspan=\"2\"><a href=\"/wiki/Instruct_your_teammates_to_recreate_your_garage_scene\" title=\"Instruct your teammates to recreate your garage scene\">3</a>\n</td>\n<td><b>Team:</b> Recreate your teammate's garage scene.\n</td>\n<td><b>3</b>\n</td>\n<td>-\n</td>\n<td><b>3</b>\n</td>\n<td>-\n</td>\n<td><b>3</b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr class=\"tmtablerow\">\n<td><b>Team:</b> Instruct your teammates to recreate your garage scene. You may not say any of the words on any of the labels. You may not leave your location. Also, you must try on all the outfits in the basket one at a time and not mention anything about it to your teammates.\n</td>\n<td>-\n</td>\n<td><b>3</b>\n</td>\n<td>-\n</td>\n<td><b>3</b>\n</td>\n<td>-\n</td></tr>\n<tr class=\"tmtablerow\">\n<td><a href=\"/wiki/Present_a_piece_called_%22Heads,_Shoulders,_Knees_and_Toes%22\" title=\"Present a piece called &quot;Heads, Shoulders, Knees and Toes&quot;\">4</a>\n</td>\n<td>Present a piece called \"Heads, Shoulders, Knees and Toes\".\n</td>\n<td>2\n</td>\n<td><b>5</b>\n</td>\n<td><b>5</b>\n</td>\n<td>4\n</td>\n<td>4\n</td></tr>\n<tr class=\"tmtablerow\">\n<td><a href=\"/wiki/Pass_the_pineapples_amongst_you_for_15_seconds\" title=\"Pass the pineapples amongst you for 15 seconds\">5</a>\n</td>\n<td><b>Live:</b> Pass the pineapples amongst you for 15 seconds while the Taskmaster shuts his eyes and has a little think. When the Taskmaster opens his eyes, he will say if he thinks you are holding a pineapple behind your back or not. If he accuses you wrongly, you will get a point.\n</td>\n<td>1\n</td>\n<td>3\n</td>\n<td>3\n</td>\n<td>4\n</td>\n<td><b>5</b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr class=\"tmtabletotal\">\n<th colspan=\"2\">Total\n</th>\n<td>9\n</td>\n<td class=\"tmtablewinner\">20\n</td>\n<td>18\n</td>\n<td>17\n</td>\n<td>17\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"External_links\">External links</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Edit section: External links\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"edit-section-anon\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://taskmaster.fandom.com/wiki/Brother_Alex.?veaction=edit&amp;sectio